        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitanwa kwa ng'wa Ezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, īmīīlaga na magūlū gako nahooye nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alīyomba Moyo ūningīla, ūnigūngūmūla nīmīīla na magūlū gane; nūng'wigwa alīniyombya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, nalīkūtūma kū Baisilaeli, kwihanga igomi īlo līnigomelile; a boi na a babyaji babo bagomi ū kūlī nene kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo nalīkūtūma kūja kūbo bagagabazu, hangī balambu no. Ūkūbawīla, ‘Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badegeleke nūūlū baleme ū kūdegeleka, nguno a boi balī numba ya būshitiigwa, nahene bakūdeeba gīkī walī wilongile ng'hangi ū mubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, ū bebe yaya ū kūbogoha a boi nūūlū ī mihayo yabo. Yaya ū kogoha gete nūūlū īkī ūpīndiwe magwaata na ming'hwa, hama ūkwikalaga hamò na ng'homi; yaya ū kwīyogoha īyo bakwīhayaga, nūūlū a boi batizūkogohya, nguno a benabo balī numba ya būshitiigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkūbawīla ī mihayo yane, badegeleke nūūlū baleme ū kūdegeleka, nguno a boi balī numba ya būshitiigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe ng'wana wa munhū, gūdegelekage ūyo nalīkūwīla. Yaya ū kūbiza shitiigwa gīt'ūmo īlī ī numba ya būshitiigwa yenīyo; asamaga ū nomo gwako ūlyī īsho nalīkwinha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naalola nūbona nkono gūgoloolilwe kwiza halī nene, gūdiimile shitabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shitabo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ī mihayo yandīkagwa ha ndīlī īnukilwe, nūūlū mafunzo gadimanyiwe gītī shilago hūna gūūkandīkījiwa gidamīīla gītī lūbbapūla. Ū kūkundīkījiwa ī shitabo shapaligagwa gītī ngeka nūūlū shilago; ū kūkundūlwa shagoloolagwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūshikundūla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūshikundūla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ūshigoloola.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū kū būtongi bone. Ū mu gatī na a higūlya shalī shandīkile mihayo ya ng'hūngū na kūlīla na mayanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
